title: "CRCI: Crisis Response Communication Infrastructure"
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-29
repository-code: "https://github.com/medwinjose/crci"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - mesh networking
  - gossip protocol
  - reputation systems
  - Byzantine fault isolation
  - Rust
abstract: >-
  Rust implementation of CRCI, a peer-to-peer gossip protocol with local
  reputation-based misbehaving-peer isolation, sliding-window replay
  protection, and the benchmark harnesses used to produce the results in the
  accompanying preprint.
